# ⚠ /tests/ USED TO BE IGNORED HERE, WHICH SILENTLY KEPT THE UNIT TESTS OUT OF THE REPO.
# `package.json` runs all 17 of them from `tests/unit/`, so a fresh clone failed on the
# first file — and they existed only on one machine. Tests are source; they belong in git.

